# Network Cable Wiring
| Cable                         | Purpose                          | Notes                             |
| ----------------------------- | -------------------------------- | --------------------------------- |
| **Straight-through Ethernet** | PC → Switch, PC → Router         | Same wiring standard on both ends |
| **Crossover Ethernet**        | Older PC → PC or Switch → Switch | TX/RX pairs crossed               |
| **Rollover Cable**            | PC → Router/Switch console port  | Used for device management        |
| **Patch Cable**               | General Ethernet connections     | Usually short Ethernet cable      |
| **Patch Fiber**               | Fiber connections                | Fiber equivalent of a patch cable |

